Addition
- [N1] Added trace (model 2): init(i1) -> action(n2,"identify the parts") -> branch(b1,XOR) -> action(n5,"are parts supplied to the customer") -> converge(c1) -> action(n7,"contract the customer") -> action(n8,"proceed with payment") -> action(n9,"end process") -> end(e1)
- [N2] Added trace (model 3): init(i1) -> action(n2,"identify the parts") -> branch(b1,XOR) -> action(n6,"order and receive part from Disuki") -> converge(c1) -> action(n7,"contract the customer") -> action(n8,"proceed with payment") -> action(n9,"end process") -> end(e1)